  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "26",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 26"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "26",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agipa wakambila Paulo ne, Udi mua kudiambila bualu buebe. Paulo wakolola tshianza, wakabanga kudividila ne,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge Agipa, ndi ne disanka bualu bua lelu ndi ngamba kudividila ku mesu kuebe bua malu onso anakubandibua kudi Bena Yuda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ndi ntamba kusanka bua wewe udi mumanye bilele bia Bena Yuda ne malu abo bimpe; ndi nkutendekena bua wewe kutelesha dî dianyi ne lutulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tshikadilu tshia muoyo wanyi ku buana buanyi, tshinakadi nʼatshi ku tshibangidilu munkatshi mua tshisamba tshianyi mene, ne ku Yelushalema, tshidi tshimanyibue kudi Bena Yuda bonso; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "biasuabo kuamba dî dilelela badi banmanye ku tshibangidilu, bu munakadi Mufalese wa tshisumbu tshia bakatamba kulamata tshitendeledi tshietu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katataka udi muimane aha bua kulumbuluishibua bua ditekemena dia mulayi wakalaya Nzambi bankambua betu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bisamba bietu dikumi ne bibidi bidi bitendelela Nzambi bikole butuku ne munya, bidi bitekemena ne, Netuhete mulayi au. Mukelenge, Bena Yuda badi bambandila bualu bua ditekemena edi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bimbisha Nzambi bafue, nudi numona bualu ebu bu bualu budi kabui bua kuitabushibua munyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bulelela, meme kabidi nakadi ngelangana meshi ne, Bundi nʼabu mbua kuenza malu a bungi adi abihisha dina dia Yesu wa ku Nazaleta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakenzenza bualu ebu kabidi mu Yelushalema; hanakangata bukole kudi bakuidi banene ba Nzambi, nakabuesha basanto ba bungi mu nsubu ya lukanu; hakimbabo kubashiha, nakitabusha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Misangu ya bungi nakadi mbakengesha mu nsunagoga yonso, nakakeba bua kubahendesha Nzambi; bualu bua nakadi nʼabo lukuna lutambe, nakabakengesha tô ne ku misoko ya bisamba bikuabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanakadi ngenza nunku, nakadi ngenda mu nshila wa ku Damaseke ne bukole ne dî bia bakuidi banene; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakafika diba munda munyi mukelenge, nakatangila munya mukole ufuma mu diulu mutambe dinkenka dia diba, wakuntemena meme ne bakadi benda nʼanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buonso buetu hatuakahona hanshi, nakunvua dî dingambila mu muaku wa Bena Ebelu ne, Shaula, Shaula, udi unkengesha meme tshinyi? Wewe udi udikengesha hautshidi usuba mikolo ku mutshi musonga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakamukonka ne, Mukelenge, wewe udi nganyi? Mukelenge wakankudimuna ne, Ndi bianyi Yesu ûdi ukengesha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi bika, wimane, bua bualu ebu nakumuenekela kûdi bua kukusungula bu muenji wa mudimu wanyi ne bu mumanyishi wa malu awakumona ne wa malu anamuenekela kûdi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nenkusungile mu bianza bia bantu ne bia bisamba bia bende, bandi nkutuma kudibo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bua wewe kubulula mesu abo, bakome nyima ku midima batangile ku munya, bakoma nyima ku bukole bua Satana batangile kudi Nzambi, bua bobo bahete dijimisha dia mibi yabo ne buhianyi munkatshi mua badi balengeshibue ku ditabusha didibo bangitabusha nʼadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku, mukelenge Agipa, tshiakahidia kutumikila tshikena kumona tshia mu diulu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi nakambila ba mu Damaseke diambedi, ne ba mu Yelushalema, ne ba mu luseke luonso lua Yudaya, ne ba bisamba bia bende kabidi, bua kukudimunabo mitshima yabo, batshinguluke kudi Nzambi, benze malu adi makanangane ne dikudimuna dia mitshima yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua bualu ebu mbuakankuatshila Bena Yuda mu ntempelo, bakeba kunshiha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua nakaheta dikuatshisha dia kudi Nzambi, ndi muimane tô ne lelu eu, nmanyisha bakese ne banene, tshi ngamba manga malu, anu akambabo kudi baprofete ne kudi Mose ne, Alualua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndi mbalesha bu mudi Kilisto mumanye mua kukenga, ne bu mudiye, wa kumudilu wa ku dibika dia bafue, wamba kumanyisha bantu ne bisamba bia bende bualu bua munya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakadiye udividila nunku, Festo wakela dî diandi bikole ne, Paulo wewe udi muhale, lungenyi luebe lua bungi ludi lukuhadisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi Paulo wakamba ne, Mukelenge Festo, tshiena muhale, kadi ndi ngamba mei a bushua ne a meshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge Agipa udi mumanye bua malu â; ndi muambilau ne dikima; bualu bua ndi ngitabusha ne, Kakuena bualu bumue bua mu malu â budi bumusokome, bua bualu ebu kabuakenjibua mu ditumba dia nsubu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge Agipa, wewe udi witabusha mei a baprofete, anyi? Ndi mumanye ne, Udi muitabushe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agipa wakambila Paulo ne, Wewe udi ukeba kungitabushisha ndue Muena Kilisto anu ne kalu kakese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo wakamba ne, Nasha ne kalu kakese nasha ne bualu bunene, ndi ndomba Nzambi kambua wewe nkayebe kadi bua bonso badi bunvua mei anyi lelu kabidi, balue bu mundi emu, anu nkanu ei idishadile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wakabika ne ngovena no Bênike ne bakadi bashikame nʼabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakumukabo, bakambilangana ne, Muntu eu kena wenza bualu bua lufu anyi bua lukanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.31",
